-- 5. Rebuild — pulse and detail resurface, bass takes the lead

-- clear the breakdown burst smoothly
xfadeIn 7 8 silence

-- pulse returns, lighter than Main
xfadeIn 2 8 $ click # gain 0.7
xfadeIn 3 8 $ degradeBy 0.45 perc # gain 0.7

-- driven bass + anchor, ghost answering above
xfadeIn 8 8 $ bassDrive # gain 0.86
xfadeIn 9 8 $ bassAnchor # gain 0.84 # lpf 280
xfadeIn 10 8 $ bassGhost # gain 0.72

-- alternate harmony colour: pulsing casio + moog stabs (no pads)
xfadeIn 4 8 $ stack [chordPulse # gain 0.74, chordStabAlt # gain 0.72]
xfadeIn 5 8 $ stack [metalTex # gain 0.66, degradeBy 0.25 $ spaceTex # gain 0.6]

-- higher, more active motif
xfadeIn 6 8 $ motifArp # gain 0.76

-- optional: add the kick for the last wave
-- xfadeIn 1 8 $ kick # gain 0.8

-- transition into the outro: ride the riser, then clear it
-- d7 riser
-- d7 silence
